From: Linux psX contributors
Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL] drm/amdgpu: PS4 preparation-only live-development owner

Adapt the frozen IB-DATA candidate, retaining all upstream notices.
Reserve and prove the owned mapping before clients; return without
calling UVD. Add cached status and one-way lifecycle invalidation.
Cleanup applies only to completed SDMA preparation, never UVD.
No active series, kernel build or hardware qualification is included.
Baseline files are pinned individually in baseline-pins.json.

